  'Eligible successful public HTML page requests are counted. Opening the catalog comparison records one approximate event named compare_open. Activating a marked manufacturer or shop product-page link records one fixed action named product_outbound_click. Counts describe request and action activity; they do not identify people or prove human visits, downloads, conversions, or purchases. Assets, redirects, errors, automated or preloaded visits, nonpublic pages, and preference actions are excluded. Requests with Do Not Track or Global Privacy Control, and browsers that opted out, are excluded too.':'符合条件且成功返回的公开 HTML 页面请求会被计数。打开车型目录的对比面板时，会记录一个近似统计事件 compare_open。点击带有标记的制造商或商店产品页链接时，会记录固定操作 product_outbound_click。这些数据用于了解请求和操作情况，不会识别个人，也不能准确表示真人访问、下载、转化或购买。静态资源、重定向、错误、自动或预加载访问、非公开页面和偏好操作会被排除。启用“请勿跟踪”或 Global Privacy Control 的请求以及已选择退出的浏览器也会被排除。',
  'When the comparison opens, this site records only the fixed event name and current page address. Your selected bikes and comparison details are not sent. Product-link actions send only their fixed action name; the product, link, page, query, referrer, client IP, and browser details are not sent with that action. Page requests also record the site you came from. The analytics service temporarily uses your IP address and browser details, plus an optional country code, to estimate sessions; it discards the IP and browser details after processing. Live page and event data, including country, are kept for 13 months; encrypted operational backups expire within 30 days after live removal. Query strings, fragments, search text, event properties, tracking identifiers, cross-site IDs, and account links are not collected. A cookie limited to this site is used only to remember your opt-out choice.':'打开对比面板时，本站仅记录固定事件名称和当前页面地址，不会发送所选车型或对比详情。产品链接操作只发送固定操作名称；该操作不会发送产品、链接、页面、查询参数、来源页面、访问者 IP 或浏览器信息。页面请求还会记录您来自哪个网站。统计服务会暂时使用您的 IP 地址和浏览器信息，并使用可选国家／地区代码估算会话；处理后会丢弃 IP 和浏览器信息。实时页面请求、事件和国家／地区数据保留 13 个月；加密的运维备份在实时数据删除后 30 天内过期。不会收集 URL 查询字符串或片段、搜索文本、事件属性、跟踪标识、跨站 ID 或账号关联。仅限本站的 cookie 只用于记住您的退出选择。',
  'Do Not Track and Global Privacy Control are honored automatically. You can also opt out with the control below; a cookie limited to this site remembers the choice. This setting applies to page counts and comparison and product-link action events.':'系统会自动尊重“请勿跟踪”和 Global Privacy Control。您也可以使用下方控件选择退出；仅限本站的 cookie 会记住此选择。此设置同时适用于页面计数、对比事件和产品链接操作事件。',
  'These forms submit to this site and work without JavaScript.':'这些表单会提交到本站，即使未启用 JavaScript 也能使用。',
  'Source and exactness for every product visual used by the catalog.':'目录中每张产品图片的来源及对应准确性。', 'Product images':'产品图片', 'Static site':'静态网站', 'Site behavior':'网站行为', 'Optional analytics':'可选流量分析', 'Opt out of optional analytics':'退出可选流量分析', 'Opt in again':'重新加入分析', 'Allow analytics':'允许分析', 'Optional videos':'可选视频', 'Public contributions':'公开贡献',
  'Where prior consent is required, optional analytics stays off until you choose Allow analytics. Elsewhere it runs by default. You can allow or withdraw it here at any time; no account is needed. Your choice is remembered in a necessary preference cookie for up to six months when allowing, or one year when declining.':'需要事先同意的地区，在你选择允许分析之前，可选分析保持关闭。其他地区默认启用。你可随时在此允许或撤回，无需账户。必要的偏好 Cookie 会记住允许选择最多六个月，或拒绝选择最多一年。',
  'Google processes analytics data outside your region. Its recipient and privacy information, contact options, and rights tools are described in':'Google 会在境外处理分析数据。接收方、隐私信息、联系渠道与权利工具见',
