  "Dated China-market road lead for the exact visible SPEEDZ complete configuration; use it as a comparison benchmark while confirming the final SKU and BOM.": "这是一条有日期的国内公路车线索，对应已识别的 SPEEDZ 整车配置；可作对比基准，购买前仍须确认最终型号和配件清单。",
  "Current exact-model evidence now identifies the electronic build as Cyclone 3rd ET and supplies its core specification; treat the retained mainland coupon range as dated until final checkout is reconfirmed.": "具体型号证据已将电子配置识别为 Cyclone 三代 ET，并补充核心规格；重新确认最终结算前，国内优惠券区间仍只视为有日期的记录。",
  "Potentially the best-manufactured frame among the lowest-priced all-road completes, but not a substitute for a 45–50C adventure frame.": "可能是低价全路况整车中制造表现较突出的车架之一，但不能替代支持 45–50C 的探索用途车架。",
