  "A rational alternative to LightCarbon; choose by geometry, delivered price, and local communication rather than carbon-grade marketing.": "可理性考虑的 LightCarbon 替代选项；应根据几何、到货总价及沟通售后选择，而不是只看碳纤维等级宣传。",
