  "The SR keeps the Speedster platform's genuinely broad 1× tire envelope, UDH, T47A and complete cockpit package at CNY 12,800; it is the value-led choice beside SR+ when the extra 65 g and manufacturer-claimed stiffness difference are acceptable.": "SR 以记录中的 12,800 元保留了 Speedster 较宽的单盘轮胎空间、UDH、T47A 与完整把组套餐。相较 SR+，能接受多出的 65 g 及厂家所称刚性差异时，它更侧重价格价值。",
